              "text": "acortar — \"to shorten; to cut short\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Por el parque acortamos camino. Going through the park shortens the way."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Acortar camino — to take a short cut; el atajo is the short cut itself."
            }
          ]
        },
